From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3: Power the CSIPHYs from their own supplies

CSIPHY0 and CSIPHY1, the rear camera's, run from l6d (0.88 V) and l4d
(1.2 V), CSIPHY2 and CSIPHY3, the front camera's, from l6b and l3b, as
the comments of the camera board file say. Name them for each pair,
so that the CSIPHYs keep their rails on themselves rather than through
the USB and PCIe PHYs that share them.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-camera.dtsi | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-camera.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-camera.dtsi
index d41f2ec66..8e13e07f7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-camera.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-camera.dtsi
@@ -142,6 +142,10 @@ &camss {
 
 	vdda-phy-supply = <&vreg_l6b>;
 	vdda-pll-supply = <&vreg_l3b>;
+	vdd-csiphy01-0p88-supply = <&vreg_l6d>;
+	vdd-csiphy01-1p2-supply = <&vreg_l4d>;
+	vdd-csiphy23-0p88-supply = <&vreg_l6b>;
+	vdd-csiphy23-1p2-supply = <&vreg_l3b>;
 
 	status = "okay";
 
